        "TileImage": "$($repository fc3dee19-c692-482d-90bc-b7900537927f).Image",
        "Description": "A luxury cruise ship listed off the coast of Iceland.\r\rIsabella and Mason didn&apos;t hesitate to push a young mother and her child back as they boareded the last life raft. &quot;We don&apos;t need the extra weight&quot; was the last thing they said to her with a self-important smirk as they released the raft, leaving them both to drown in the rising black waters.\r\rThat was 10 years ago.\r\rThe mother had indeed drowned, giving her life vest to her son, who endured. Now, he has issued this double ICA contract.",
